    {
      "index": 9,
      "type": "recap",
      "narration": "Let's recap. Manual cleaning has seven steps, and brushing every channel is the one that removes biofilm. High-level disinfection needs validated cycles, the correct connectors and the correct chemistry. Next, we'll cover rinsing, drying, storage, and the duodenoscope elevator.",
      "audioFile": "audio/vo/ms-cssd-15/V803/scene-9.mp3",
      "voDurationInSeconds": 21.12,
      "voDurationInFrames": 634,
